<title>BRAZIL: Brazil markets closed Thursday, Friday for Easter.</title>
<headline>Brazil markets closed Thursday, Friday for Easter.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial markets will be closed Thursday and Friday for Easter holidays.</p>
<p>Markets will reopen as normal on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Sao Paulo Newsroom 55-11-2485412))</p>
</text>
